      "wild_mega": "a chamber Habitat Block (or spawn_pool_world entry bounded to the chamber) whose one entry carries '<species> mega_evolution=<mega|mega_x|mega_y> uncatchable', fightorflight always_aggro_aspects += mega, mega_x, mega_y; the chamber is built with no light source so it stays at 7 or less. The owner's 'all wild mega pokemon that are uncatchable and enraged'. Still to prove (EXP-036): the ball refused in play, enraged by the config line, spawning from a pool rather than a command.",
